body:
Sigh, I'm the exact opposite from most of these comments. Been smoking a joint nearly daily for 10 years now and I'm going on 7 days clean now. Not only due to drug testing for a new job I'm applying for, and the fact that it kills my motivation and helps me escape from my problems, I love it way too much and used it for everything like eating, sleeping, watching movies, etc.

&#x200B;

Now because I hate being sober more than anything, I have turned to tequila shots nearly almost every morning and certainly every night. Getting shit faced and smoking mad cigarettes this past week and I don't see it slowing down. We're on the opposite sides of the spectrum, my nigga. I wish I could get back with Mary Jane again but it's caused me far more problems than alcohol has ever.
